TalkNet architecture vendored from TalkNet-ASD
=============================================

Files under `gaeclip/talknet/_upstream/` (attentionLayer.py,
audioEncoder.py, visualEncoder.py, talkNetModel.py) are adapted from the
TalkNet-ASD repository:

    https://github.com/TaoRuijie/TalkNet-ASD

Copyright (c) 2021 Tao Ruijie, MIT License. Only the module import lines
were changed (absolute `model.*` imports rewritten to the vendored
package path); the network architecture is byte-identical so the upstream
`pretrain_TalkSet.model` checkpoint loads without conversion.

Preprocessing (MFCC parameters, 112x112 face crops, 25 fps windowing)
follows the upstream dataLoader/demo conventions, reimplemented with
numpy/OpenCV only (no python_speech_features / scipy dependency).

Everything outside `_upstream/` (device detection, batching, cache,
escalation, fusion, pipeline integration) is original Gaeclip code.
